          </div>
          <div class="luna-features__copy">
            <span class="luna-features__badge">Argan Oil Infused Ceramic</span>
            <h3 class="luna-features__title">Smooth shine for straight styles and soft curls.</h3>
            <p class="luna-features__text">
              Luna’s Argan Oil infused ceramic technology is used across the Straightener and Curling Wand to help create smooth, polished, glossy results.
            </p>
            <ul class="luna-features__bullets">
              <li>Helps smooth the look of frizz</li>
              <li>Supports shine and a polished finish</li>
              <li>Ceramic glide for easier styling</li>
              <li>Works across straight and curled looks</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/products/ceramic-argan-oil-infused-straightener" class="luna-features__link">Explore Argan Oil Tools</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="luna-features__card" style="margin-top:14px;">
          <div class="luna-features__media luna-features__media--tech">
            <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0609/7426/8657/files/Artboard1_1_3x_369b8461-0ff3-47c6-81bd-904e93a852c3.png?v=1776848608" alt="Argan Oil infused ceramic plate technology" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="luna-features__copy">
