    <div class="luna-features__proof-grid">
      <div class="luna-features__proof">
        <strong>Argan Oil ceramic glide</strong>
        <span>Designed to help hair feel smoother through every styling pass.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="luna-features__proof">
        <strong>Straight + curl styling</strong>
        <span>One beauty technology story across Luna’s core styling tools.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="luna-features__proof">
        <strong>Real-use performance</strong>
        <span>Visual results, practical tools and styling confidence at home.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="luna-features__proof">
        <strong>Value without compromise</strong>
        <span>Beauty-led hair tools without the inflated premium price tag.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="luna-features__closing">
      <h3>Join the Luna way of styling.</h3>
      <p>Smart tools. Real results. Better value. Luna is for women who want good hair without overpaying for it.</p>
      <a href="/collections/meet-luna" class="luna-features__cta">Shop the Luna Range</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

